      "message": "I would be careful with changing public API and only when we have strong reasons then consider to change it.\n\nI also think it could be less complex if we use headers in implementation and not make more complex FetchOptionsInit interface. But that\u0027s nit.",
      "revId": "5e31849a16466e1677a2e719c99803a52f5f52bc",
